  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Final Day",
    "summary": "As [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, every **TYRANIDS SYNAPSE** unit of yours lets you pick 2 units of yours, each **visible** to it and up to 9\" from it: a **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit (not a **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALER** or **PATRIARCH** unit) and a **TYRANIDS** unit. If you do:\n\n- the **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit takes D3+1 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)\n- a model of the **TYRANIDS** unit regains lost wounds, at most as many as that roll\n- attacks by models of the **TYRANIDS** unit get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) until [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase)\n\nYour **TYRANIDS** units get the **Catalyst (Aura)** ability:\n\n**Aura (6\")**: attacks by your **GENESTEALER CULTS** units against enemy units in range get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).",
